---
title: Visually Hidden
description: Hides content visually while keeping it available to screen readers. Useful for icon-only buttons and extra context for links.
tags: [accessibility, utility, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<button type="button">
  <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
  <span class="visually-hidden">Close dialog</span>
</button>
